Open bugs are falling by about 26 a week, which would leave about 80 open by 2026-11-20.

## Features

The 9 remaining features by status.

table = feature,status; Fishing mini-game,In progress; Ship customization,In progress; Co-op invites,In progress; Photo mode,In progress; Harbor festival events,Not started; Achievements,Not started; Accessibility options,Not started; Weather-driven trading,Cut candidate; Pet companion,Cut candidate

## Risks

- **Performance.** The busiest harbor scene runs 2 fps below target. The optimization sprint is booked for 2026-11-02 to 2026-11-13.
- **Accessibility options have not started.** They are required for the console certification submission on 2027-02-08.
- **Cut decision.** Dropping the two cut candidates would save about 6 weeks of work. The decision is needed by 2026-10-30.
